Pika ships this third-party code, each with its notice and licence beside it:

- bake/bc7enc: the BC7 encoder from Richard Geldreich's bc7enc_rdo, under
  the MIT licence (bake/bc7enc/NOTICE), compiled into the bake tool.
- bake/libraries: the texture sampling file of the MaterialX project's Slang
  generator, modified for Pika's UDIM arrays, under the Apache License 2.0
  (bake/libraries/NOTICE), compiled into every material shader.

A binary distribution of the bake tool carries these notices with it.
